    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The projectile breaks several of your ribs. This will make any breathing and physical exertions a proper pain in your patookas!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a Broken Bone (Minor). \n If the projectile was a Lead Bullet you reroll the result once. If the result comes up as Pneumothorax or any higher result you use the Pneumothorax result instead as the bullet penetrates your chest. On any other result, use the Broken Ribs result instead.</p>"
